# Build context is the repo root. Default-deny, then allow only what images need.
*
!versions.env
!scripts/
!lab/Dockerfile
!lab/rootfs/
!app/
# Never send these, even if they appear under an allowed path
**/.git
**/.gnupg
**/*.gpg
**/*.asc.key
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.env
**/*.env.local
**/secrets/
reports/
evidence/
**/*.tar
